 <p>By default, ImageMagick supports up to 32 channels.  As of ImageMagick version 7.1.1-16, you can enable up to 64 channels by adding the <code>--enable-64bit-channel-masks</code> option to the Linux configure build script.  For Windows, just select the option from the configure application.</p>
 
